<title>USA: Morgan Products completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Morgan Products completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIAMSBURG, Va. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Products Ltd said Tuesday it completed its previously announced purchase of Tennessee Buildings Products Inc and its subsidiary, Titan Building Products Inc.</p>
<p>The cash purchase price was about $15 million with an estimated $2.3 million in assumed payables and other liabilities.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect this business will be a contributor to our improving profitability in 1996 and beyond,&quot; said Morgan president Larry Robinette in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
